      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "transparent": false,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Lote de SupportOps: **agente → gateway LLM, orders-api, kb-search**. Arriba, **trazas** (TraceQL); en medio, **series calculadas al consultar** (TraceQL metrics); abajo, **métricas pregeneradas** (metrics-generator, requieren `TEMPO_CONFIG=tempo-metrics.yaml`)."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Trazas (TraceQL)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Tickets con error (raíz = agente)",
      "description": "Trazas cuyo span raíz es del agente y terminó en error. Pulsa el traceID para abrir la traza. Filtra primero por trace:rootService (intrínseco barato).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ trace:rootService = \"supportops-agent\" && span.supportops.status = \"error\" }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "filters": [],
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Bucles de herramientas (> 3 execute_tool por traza)",
      "description": "Agregado de TraceQL: trazas con más de 3 spans execute_tool. Detecta bucles sin atributos especiales.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ span.gen_ai.operation.name = \"execute_tool\" } | count() > 3",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "filters": [],
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
